# Backend config is per-operator (backend TYPE can't be parameterized in
# Terraform, so committing one forces it — and its account-specific
# bucket — on everyone). Each operator copies backend.tf.example to
# backend.tf and picks their own backend; a fresh clone uses local state.
backend.tf
